{'symbol': 'EXR', 'date': '2021-08-23 16:15:00', 'title': 'EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC. ANNOUNCES 3RD QUARTER 2021 DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SALT LAKE CITY, AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC.\xa0(THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: EXR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY\'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.25 PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY FOR THE THIRD QUARTER 2021, A 25% INCREASE FROM THE PREVIOUS QUARTER.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON SEPTEMBER 30, 2021 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPTEMBER 15, 2021.'}